<title>USA: Magellan to buy back up to three mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Magellan to buy back up to three mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magellan Health Services Inc said Friday that its board has approved the repurchase of up to three million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>This buyback is in addition to a recently completed Dutch tender of nearly four million shares at $18.375 each, the company said.</p>
</text>
